msgstr ""
"HTTP Progressive (HTTPTS, FLV) bietet einfaches Streaming mit geringer "
"Latenz für kompatible Player."

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.5nL9WJwhMP/lsp-markers.js:323
msgid ""
"HTTP trigger handlers receive a POST with the trigger name in the X-Trigger "
