msgid ""
"HTTPS is not configured. For secure playback, either enable the HTTPS "
"protocol in "
msgstr ""
"HTTPS ist nicht konfiguriert. Für eine sichere Wiedergabe aktivieren Sie "
"entweder das HTTPS-Protokoll in "

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.5nL9WJwhMP/lsp-markers.js:325
msgid "https://example.com/stream.m3u8"
msgstr "https://example.com/stream.m3u8"

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.5nL9WJwhMP/lsp-markers.js:326
