msgid ""
"Ingest live streams via RTMP, SRT, WebRTC (WHIP), RTSP, RIST, or direct TS "
"push."
msgstr ""
"Nehmen Sie Live-Streams über RTMP, SRT, WebRTC (WHIP), RTSP, RIST oder "
"direkten TS-Push auf."

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.5nL9WJwhMP/lsp-markers.js:332
