"Player skins and keyboard shortcuts are fully configurable via the "
"MistVideoObject API."
msgstr ""
"Player-Skins und Tastaturkürzel sind vollständig über die MistVideoObject-"
"API konfigurierbar."

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.5nL9WJwhMP/lsp-markers.js:449
